OL,3,GNEWSABusy road closed after crash
OL,4,Ainvolving motorbikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA busy road has been closed after a
OL,7,Fcrash involving two motorbikes.
OL,9,FNational Highways said the A14 was shut
OL,10,Feastbound in Suffolk, between junction
OL,11,F59 for Trimley St Martin and junction
OL,12,F60 for Trimley St Mary near Felixstowe,
OL,13,Fat about 12:20 BST.
OL,15,FIt said Suffolk Police were at the
OL,16,Fscene and officers had put a diversion
OL,17,Fin place.
OL,19,FDrivers were warned there were delays
OL,20,Fof 30 minutes on the approach to the
OL,21,Fincident with three miles (4.8km) worth
OL,22,Fof congestion.
